From 70b7b52e255851d095e225b8e379f2f9b1cae319 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yusheng Zheng <yunwei356@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:06:47 +0000
Subject: [RFC PATCH bpf-next v1 4/5] selftests/bpf: Exercise kinsn calls and
 verifier rules

Kinsn proof lowering and native emission need coverage for pairing, payload
decoding, filtering, register preservation, and invalid proofs. Add test
kfuncs with registered descriptors and x86-64 and arm64 emitters. Exercise
successful calls, multiple descriptors, and verifier rejections through
test_progs. Keep the test kfunc definitions in the standard kfunc
definition section.
---
 tools/testing/selftests/bpf/Makefile            |   2 +-
 tools/testing/selftests/bpf/prog_tests/kinsn.c  |  12 +
 .../bpf/prog_tests/kinsn_registration.c         |  20 ++
 tools/testing/selftests/bpf/progs/kinsn.c       | 239 ++++++++++++++++++
 tools/testing/selftests/bpf/test_kmods/Makefile |   2 +-
 .../test_kmods/bpf_test_kinsn_registration.c    |  68 +++++
 .../selftests/bpf/test_kmods/bpf_testmod.c      | 247 +++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 588 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

